# AI Search Router — Project Rules (Concise)

## Purpose

Browser extension that routes searches to AI engines or traditional SERPs using fast, deterministic query classification (no ML/LLM).

```
/
├─ packages/
│  ├─ core/        # @ai-search-router/core (classifier + providers)
│  └─ extension/   # @ai-search-router/extension (shared WebExtension)
└─ platforms/
   ├─ chromium/    # Chrome/Edge/Brave build
   └─ safari/      # Xcode wrapper (future)
```

Managed with pnpm workspaces. Core is reused by extension; extension is reused by platforms.

## Extension (`packages/extension`)

- MV3 service worker intercepts searches
- Loads preferences from storage
- Calls `@ai-search-router/core` for classification
- Redirects to the selected provider URL
